From: juansolo457 <5344231+Juansolo457@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 19:09:26 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 18/21] Vulkan: enable textureCompressionBC and
 shaderStorageImageWriteWithoutFormat

With GPU emulation the device enables the features the Vulkan command
processor uses, but not these two. F.E.A.R.'s renderer records on the
presenter's device (port-nx/src/d3d12/vulkan_device.h) and needs both:
BC1-BC5 textures uploaded as they are, and its color resolve shader,
which writes the destination's texel bits through a uint storage view
of an image with no format in the shader.

Enable them where the GPU supports them, and record them in the
device's Properties like the other enabled features. Nothing in the SDK
reads them, so its own renderer is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 include/rex/ui/vulkan/device.h  | 2 ++
 src/ui/vulkan/vulkan_device.cpp | 4 ++++
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/rex/ui/vulkan/device.h b/include/rex/ui/vulkan/device.h
index 3bd17dc..adf6847 100644
--- a/include/rex/ui/vulkan/device.h
+++ b/include/rex/ui/vulkan/device.h
@@ -113,6 +113,8 @@ class VulkanDevice {
     bool shaderCullDistance = false;
     bool sparseBinding = false;
     bool sparseResidencyBuffer = false;
+    bool textureCompressionBC = false;
+    bool shaderStorageImageWriteWithoutFormat = false;
 
     // VK_KHR_sampler_mirror_clamp_to_edge (#15, promoted to 1.2)
 
diff --git a/src/ui/vulkan/vulkan_device.cpp b/src/ui/vulkan/vulkan_device.cpp
index f2e5f50..1ee4225 100644
--- a/src/ui/vulkan/vulkan_device.cpp
+++ b/src/ui/vulkan/vulkan_device.cpp
@@ -655,6 +655,10 @@ std::unique_ptr<VulkanDevice> VulkanDevice::CreateIfSupported(
     XE_UI_VULKAN_FEATURE(shaderCullDistance)
     XE_UI_VULKAN_FEATURE(sparseBinding)
     XE_UI_VULKAN_FEATURE(sparseResidencyBuffer)
+    // F.E.A.R.'s renderer on this device (port-nx/src/d3d12/vulkan_device.h): BC textures, and
+    // the color resolve shader's storage writes to a uint view of the destination.
+    XE_UI_VULKAN_FEATURE(textureCompressionBC)
+    XE_UI_VULKAN_FEATURE(shaderStorageImageWriteWithoutFormat)
   }
 
   if (properties.apiVersion >= VK_MAKE_API_VERSION(0, 1, 2, 0)) {
